  "solution": "**Given:**\n\n2tan245° + cos230° - sin260°\n\n**Concept used:**\n\ntan(45°) = 1,\n\ncos(30°) = √3/2,\n\nsin(60°) = √3/2,\n\n**Calculation:**\n\n⇒ 2tan245° = 2(1)² = 2,\n\n⇒ cos230° = (√3/2)² = 3/4,\n\n⇒ sin260 = (√3/2)2 = 3/4,\n\n⇒ 2 + 3/4 - 3/4 = 2 + 0 = 2\n\n**Thus, the value is 2.**",
